  "description": "Optional MySQL and MariaDB function catalog for the SqlNative light-weight ORM. Adds the\n      MySqlFunctions class with 376 built-in functions and operators covering strings, dates, numeric, JSON, spatial,\n      aggregates, window functions and more, exposed as documented C# methods that return SQL text. Function names\n      and argument counts are compile-checked, the XML docs record argument order and MySQL/MariaDB availability, and\n      the SQL stays fully visible.",
